WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.682
First close-ups of

00:00:01.494 --> 00:00:02.956
an asteroid smash

00:00:03.486 --> 00:00:04.889
ESA's Hera mission

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:05.585
has returned the

00:00:05.396 --> 00:00:06.964
first close-up images

00:00:06.776 --> 00:00:07.743
of the impact

00:00:07.613 --> 00:00:08.332
of the DART

00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:09.382
asteroid deflection

00:00:09.194 --> 00:00:10.030
experiment

00:00:10.231 --> 00:00:11.233
the crater left

00:00:11.045 --> 00:00:12.035
behind by the

00:00:11.847 --> 00:00:12.601
impact

00:00:13.126 --> 00:00:14.104
The pictures show

00:00:13.916 --> 00:00:15.331
the chaotic aftermath

00:00:15.178 --> 00:00:16.074
of the cosmic

00:00:15.885 --> 00:00:16.687
smashup

00:00:16.852 --> 00:00:17.630
the scene where

00:00:17.442 --> 00:00:19.199
a spacecraft deliberately

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.284
