00:00:20.756 --> 00:00:21.345
path

00:00:21.878 --> 00:00:22.467
It is the

00:00:22.279 --> 00:00:23.045
first look at

00:00:22.857 --> 00:00:23.870
what a planetary

00:00:23.682 --> 00:00:25.191
defence impact really

00:00:25.003 --> 00:00:26.040
leaves behind in

00:00:25.852 --> 00:00:26.536
space

00:00:27.054 --> 00:00:28.068
Full story on

00:00:27.879 --> 00:00:28.775
the dashboard
